  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 88f6fa2b89436164b8e97b17d82dc9a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 7 - Operator
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UtilityScriptIWrite::HintSO
  hintId: tutorial_operator
  isUnlockedByDefault: 1
  ignoreLock: 0
  title: Operator
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: "Operators are symbols used to perform calculations on values.\r\n\r\nCommon
    arithmetic operators:\r\n<font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#7FDFFF>+</color></font>
    \u2192 addition\r\n<font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#7FDFFF>-</color></font>
    \u2192 subtraction\r\n<font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#7FDFFF>*</color></font>
    \u2192 multiplication\r\n<font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#7FDFFF>/</color></font>
    \u2192 division\r\n<font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#7FDFFF>%</color></font>
    \u2192 modulo (remainder)\r\n<font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#7FDFFF>//</color></font>
    \u2192 floor division\r\n<font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#7FDFFF>**</color></font>
    \u2192 exponent\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n<font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#81C784>a</color>
    = <color=#7FDFFF>10</color> <color=#7FDFFF>+</color> <color=#7FDFFF>8</color></font>\r\n\r\nThe
    <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#7FDFFF>+</color></font> operator can also
    combine text (string values).\r\nExample:\r\n<font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#FF6EC7>\"Hello
    \"</color> <color=#7FDFFF>+</color> <color=#FF6EC7>\"Robot\"</color></font>"
  isImageBig: 0
